      "lines": [
        "复习题"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "303",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "作下列各式给出的函数的图象：",
        "а) $y=0.2x$；　　б) $y=-\\frac{1}{3}x$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "304",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "当系数 $k$ 取什么值时，式 $y=kx$ 给出的函数的图象经过",
        "点 $A(0.3,2)$？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "20．线性函数的图象"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "用式 $y=0.5x+2$ 给出线性函数 $f$，现在要作出它的图象。",
        "让 $x$ 取一些值，求出变量 $x$ 和 $y$ 的对应值并列表："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "label": "表",
      "box": [
        157,
        964,
        1106,
        167
      ],
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [],
      "id": "tbl-p0094-01"
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "根据表中列出的坐标描点。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "不难看出，描出的点都在某一直线上（图 $74$）。但是从这",
        "一点还不能得出已知函数 $f$ 的图象是一条直线。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "为了弄清楚函数 $f$ 的图象的形状，我们可以将 $f$ 的图象",
        "和我们熟悉的正比例函数 $x\\xrightarrow{g}y$（其中 $y=0.5x$）的图象作一",
        "比较。"
      ]
    },
